OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fisolated light showers mostly over the
OL,7,FPennines. Cloud infilling with showers
OL,8,Fbecoming more widespread through the
OL,9,Fmorning and early afternoon but
OL,10,Fremaining mostly light and many areas
OL,11,Fremaining dry. Temperatures around
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA dry, partly cloudy start to
OL,15,Fthe evening for most areas. Cloud
OL,16,Fbuilding from the west with a series
OL,17,Fof rain bands overnight, lingering
OL,18,Finto Thursday morning. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
