OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FOvernight rain and cloud
OL,6,Fclears to a mostly dry and partly
OL,7,Fcloudy morning. Isolated showers
OL,8,Fbubble up over the hills in the north
OL,9,Fand west. Feeling cooler in blustery
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Funsettled to start the period with
OL,14,Ffurther rain and blustery winds
OL,15,Fthrough Friday and into Saturday.
OL,16,FTurning drier and brighter on Sunday.
OL,17,FTemperatures remain around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
